oted in very big numbers for me in our Historic 2024 Presidential Campaign. TREMENDOUS SUPPORT!\n\u00a0\nTODAY, the eyes of the Country are on New York again!\n\u00a0\nCongressman Mike Lawler has been a tremendous friend to the Jewish community and a strong leader in the fight against antisemitism. He has stood with the community when it mattered most, speaking out against hatred, and standing up for Religious Freedom and School Choice!\n\u00a0\nMike has worked tirelessly for his constituents, for our Country, and for the Jewish people. He understands the importance of strong leadership, protecting our communities, and delivering REAL RESULTS for the people he represents.\n\u00a0\nHis dedication to public service and his willingness to stand up for what he believes in have made a tremendous difference. That kind of commitment should never be taken for granted!\n\u00a0\nWorking together with your State Senator Bill Weber, Mike will continue to be your voice, and fight for you and your family!\n\u00a0\nEVERY VOTE MATTERS. MAKE YOUR VOICE HEARD TODAY. VOTE MIKE LAWLER FOR CONGRESS \u2014 HE WILL NEVER LET YOU DOWN! President DONALD J. TRUMP","url":"https://truthsocial.com/@realDonaldTrump/117554198887656582","time":"2026-11-03T19:38:44.236Z","media":0},{"text":"Lightweight Congressman Ted Lieu, one of the least respected in Washington, D.C., made a knowingly malicious, false, and defamatory statement that I wanted to change the name of the Lincoln Memorial Reflecting Pool to the Trump Reflecting Pool. He posted on X, \"What are Trump and his Republican enablers focused on? Changing the name of the Lincoln Memorial Reflecting Pool to the Trump Reflecting Pool. Punish them at the ballot box. Repudiate them. Vote.\" Ted Lieu knows that I said it in a jocular manner, and added, immediately after, \"Don't worry, I'm only joking.\" All of the gathered Reporters laughed. But \u201cLightweight\u201d Lieu, his new moniker, didn\u2019t add the line that I\u2019m only joking because he is a FRAUD. This was done at a News Conference, and even the Media was aghast that Lieu would have lied like that. He's a Third Rate Congressman, and always will be! Thank you for your attention to this matter. President DONALD J. TRUMP","url":"https://truthsocial.com/@realDonaldTrump/117553680973466314","time":"2026-11-03T17:27:01.493Z","media":0},{"text":"The Daily Mail wrongly took my joke at a Presidential News Conference where the beautiful Lincoln Memorial Reflecting Pool was opened yesterday, and pretended it wasn't a joke when I said, I'm going to name it, \"TRUMP.\" Their dishonest, false headline states: \"Trump delivers final midterms speech to just 60 people at the renovated Reflecting Pool and threatens a major rename.\" It wasn't a \"Final Midterms Speech\" that only had 60 people, it was a NEWS CONFERENCE, nobody was invited, it was closed to the Public \u2014\u00a0Just Reporters. My Final Midterms Speech was the day before in lowa and Kansas, where we had 50,000 people. This just shows you how FAKE the News is. I said, very clearly, \"I'm joking.\" The Fake News is so corrupt! President DONALD J. TRUMP","url":"https://truthsocial.com/@realDonaldTrump/117553650492622207","time":"2026-11-03T17:19:16.392Z","media":0},{"text":"Trump\u2019s Midterm Travel Runs Circles Around Obama, Biden:\nhttps://www.dailysignal.com/2026/11/03/trumps-midterm-travel-blitz-surpasses-predecessors/","url":"https://truthsocial.com/@realDonaldTrump/117553613220175280","time":"2026-11-03T17:09:47.661Z","media":0},{"text":"Guam, which has always been considered strongly Democrat, just had an early call for a REPUBLICAN Victory in the top spot, Governor \u2014 Congratulations to Tony Ada! Also, the Republicans have the Majority in the State Senate. Wow, hopefully that\u2019s an indication for things to come! President DONALD J. TRUMP","url":"https://truthsocial.com/@realDonaldTrump/117553605765659226","time":"2026-11-03T17:07:53.913Z","media":0},{"text":"TO THE GREAT PEOPL